B.aBa=new A.cK("How do I export my sessions?","Go to the Sessions tab and tap the Import/Export button in the top-right. Choose Export, select CSV or Excel format, and the file will be generated and ready to save or share. CSV works with any spreadsheet app; Excel exports a formatted .xlsx file.")
